      "role": "user",
      "content": "the lantern thing makes sense but it still feels kinda weird. i remember reading somewhere that einstein called it \"spooky action at a distance\" because it seemed so impossible. why did he call it spooky? like what is actually happening there that makes it feel so unnatural?",
      "source": "evaluator"
